Z||000000||grgoyl86||08-30-2001||08:51 PM||||I'm posting this for a club member:<P>The E-town Buick / Pontiac / Olds show is coming up real fast. To make an effective show of Fiero force, we need a bunch to show up.<BR>I'd love to see many of you there. Your Fiero's are beautiful and I think the Jersey Firebird, GTO, GS (Grand Sport) etc. guys would be quite impressed.<BR>I hope a bunch of you can make it here. <BR>Thanks in advance.<BR>If you'd like to meet at my place early Saturday morning ,e-mail me back and I'll send you directions.                   <BR>    <BR>Raceways Parks website is <A HREF="http://www.etownraceway.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.etownraceway.com/</A> <BR>                                             Bob Ricci<BR>Sayrebrick@aol.com||||reg||14
